1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,667
Bo: The bottles are empty. All of them.

2
00:00:08,733 --> 00:00:11,800
Ren: The tower still stands. We go there.

3
00:00:12,667 --> 00:00:16,067
Ren: Hold my hand, Bo. Don't look down.

4
00:00:16,333 --> 00:00:18,867
Bo: I'm holding on. Keep going.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,800
Ren: Someone is still sending. Listen.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,567
Bo: Then we're not alone.
